    "title": "<p>Diagnostic criteria for rosette-forming glioneuronal tumour</p>",
    "legend": "",
    "source": "Dominique Figarella-Branger",
    "copyright": "",
    "tablehtml": "<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; \" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\" \">\r\n<td style=\"width: 444.85pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"593\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong style=\"\"><em style=\"\">Essential:</em></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 444.85pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"593\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\" \">Biphasic histomorphology with a neurocytic component and a glial component</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 444.85pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"593\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong style=\"\"><span style=\"\">AND</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 444.85pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"593\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\" \">Uniform neurocytes forming rosettes and/or perivascular pseudorosettes associated with synaptophysin expression</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 444.85pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"593\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong style=\"\"><span style=\"\">AND (for unresolved lesions)</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 36.8pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"49\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\" \"><span style=\"\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 408.05pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"544\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\" \">Small biopsies showing only one tumour component (neurocytic or glial) and a methylation profile of rosette-forming glioneuronal tumour</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 444.85pt; background: #EFF6FC; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"593\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong style=\"\"><em style=\"\">Desirable:</em></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\" \">\r\n<td style=\"width: 444.85pt; background: #EFF6FC; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"593\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><em style=\"\"><span style=\"\">FGFR1</span></em><span style=\" \"> mutation with co-occurring </span><em style=\"\"><span style=\"\">PIK3CA</span></em><span style=\" \"> and/or </span><em style=\"\"><span style=\"\">NF1</span></em><span style=\" \"> mutation</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>",
